          "text": "$F = e^{x+y}+z-ez$:",
          "math": "$$F_x' = e^{x+y}, F_y' = e^{x+y}, F_z' = 1-e. \\\\[4pt]  \\\\[4pt] В (0,0,1): F_x' = 1, F_y' = 1, F_z' = 1-e.$$"
